      "content": "Kindly update src/payments/handler.py to implement banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN). Use Decimal with quantize as shown below:\n\nfrom decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\ndef charge_amount(cents: int, fx_rate: float) -> int:\n    result = Decimal(cents) * Decimal(str(fx_rate))\n    return int(result.quantize(Decimal('1'), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN))\n\nThis ensures values like 105 * 1.5 = 157.5 round to 158 (nearest even)."
